        <!-- Find all qa blocks that belong to this group -->
        
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-1" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-1')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-1"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">What is Medral?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-1" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Medral is one of India's fastest-growing B2B nutraceutical contract manufacturers, headquartered in Mohali, Punjab and a brand of Livo Universal Healthcare Pvt. Ltd. Founded in 2015 by Tanishq Dhingra and Tejasvi Dhingra with just ₹20,000, we have grown into a ₹200–250 Crore enterprise. We specialise in sports nutrition and wellness supplements, serving 250+ brands across India and globally with 10+ years of manufacturing excellence.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-2" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-2')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-2"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">What services does Medral offer?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-2" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>We offer a complete range of manufacturing services including Third-Party Manufacturing, Private Labelling, White Labelling, Custom Formulation, and R&D Support. Beyond manufacturing, we also assist with FSSAI Licensing documentation, GST registration guidance, in-house Label and Packaging Design, and full brand building support. Everything is available under one roof so our clients never need to coordinate multiple vendors.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-3" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-3')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-3"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">What certifications does Medral hold?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-3" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>We hold 10+ international certifications including ISO 9001:2015, WHO-GMP, GMP, FDA Compliance, FSSAI (License No. 12122999000378), HACCP, ISO 14001:2015 EMS, ISO 22000:2018 FSMS, and ISO 45001:2018. These certifications cover quality management, food safety, environmental management, and occupational health — ensuring our facility meets the highest global manufacturing standards for every batch produced.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-4" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-4')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-4"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">Where is Medral located?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-4" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Our primary manufacturing unit is at D-173, Industrial Area Phase 8B, Mohali – 160071, Punjab, India. We also operate a second manufacturing facility at Plot No. 45, Mega Food Park, Near South City, Ludhiana – 141008, Punjab. Our corporate office is at ENKAY Tower, Phase V, Udyog Vihar, Sector 19, Gurugram, Haryana 122016. Clients are welcome to visit our Mohali facility in person for consultations and sample approvals.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-5" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-5')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-5"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">How many brands has Medral worked with?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-5" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Medral has partnered with 250+ valued clients and brands across India and internationally. Our client portfolio spans startups launching their first SKU to well-established brands scaling nationally. We work with 100+ raw material vendors globally, ensuring premium sourcing for every formulation. Our track record includes brands across sports nutrition, wellness, D2C e-commerce, gym retail, and pharmacy channels.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-6" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-6')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-6"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">Is Medral a B2B or B2C company?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-6" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Medral is strictly a B2B (Business-to-Business) contract manufacturer. We manufacture products exclusively for brands and do not sell directly to end consumers. Our clients include supplement brands, startups, entrepreneurs, gym chains, fitness coaches, distributors, and e-commerce sellers who sell products under their own brand name. We are the manufacturing backbone behind many well-known supplement brands in India.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-7" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-7')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-7"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">What is the production capacity of Medral?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-7" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Our combined production capacity across our Mohali and Ludhiana manufacturing facilities is 20 tons per day. We have 150+ skilled employees, 3+ in-house formulation and R&D development centres, and 3+ warehouses for raw materials, packaging, and finished goods. This scale allows us to serve both small startup brands with their first batch and large enterprises with high-volume ongoing production requirements simultaneously.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-8" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-8')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-8"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">Can I visit the Medral facility before placing an order?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-8" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Yes, absolutely. We welcome client visits to our Mohali manufacturing facility. A factory visit allows you to review our production infrastructure, raw material warehouse, quality control lab, and R&D centres firsthand. Visiting in person also saves time and money on samples — our team can prepare product samples on-site during your visit at no extra courier cost. Please contact our sales team at sales@medralhealth.com to schedule your visit.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-9" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-9')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-9"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">What makes Medral different from other manufacturers?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-9" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>We differentiate ourselves through 10+ international certifications, world-class raw material sourcing from 100+ global vendors, advanced in-house R&D labs, a strict No False Claims policy, and complete end-to-end support from formulation to dispatch — all under one roof. Every client gets a dedicated Account Manager and Director-level oversight. Our transparent Open File System gives clients full visibility into their product formulation and ingredient sourcing, which is rare in the industry.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-10" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-10')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-10"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">Does Medral have a No False Claims policy?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-10" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Yes. Our No False Claims policy is a core pillar of our business ethics. We strictly prohibit amino spiking, false protein value inflation, misleading label declarations, or claims that cannot be scientifically substantiated. Every product we manufacture delivers exactly what the label states — verified through our in-house quality control and batch testing process. This policy protects both our clients' brand reputation and end-consumers' trust.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          <div class="faq-item" id="faqItem-qa-general-11" >
            <button
              class="faq-item__q"
              onclick="faqToggle('qa-general-11')"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="faqAns-qa-general-11"
            >
              <span class="faq-item__arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
              </span>
              <span class="faq-item__text">How can I contact Medral to get started?</span>
              <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/></svg>
              </span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-general-11" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>You can reach our sales team at <strong>sales@medralhealth.com</strong> or call/WhatsApp us at <strong>+91 78892 02281</strong>. Our business hours are Monday to Saturday, 9:00 AM to 6:00 PM IST, with WhatsApp support available for urgent enquiries. Simply share your product idea, target audience, budget, and quantity requirements — and our team will respond within 24 hours with personalised guidance and a preliminary cost estimate.</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
          
