            <div class="faq-item__a" id="faqAns-qa-pricing-1" role="region" hidden>
              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>For standard protein formulations the minimum batch size is <strong>500 kg across 2 flavours</strong>. For unique or non-basic formulations using special or patented ingredients, the minimum increases to <strong>1000 kg across 2 flavours</strong>. This higher MOQ for unique formulas is necessary to recover the additional R&D, testing, and sourcing costs. We support startups with these startup-friendly MOQs — you don't need to order thousands of units to get started.</p></div>
