              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>Mass gainer MOQ is <strong>1200 kg</strong> (standard) or <strong>2400 kg</strong> (unique formulation) across 2 flavours. Pre-workout, BCAA, EAA, creatine, and glutamine MOQs are <strong>1000 pieces</strong> (standard) or <strong>2000 pieces</strong> (unique) across 2 flavours. Multivitamins start at <strong>2000 pieces</strong> standard. Unique formulation MOQs are double the standard in all categories due to higher R&D and procurement costs.</p></div>
