              <div class="faq-item__a-inner"><p>You can initiate your supplement brand project with a token payment of just <strong>₹51,000</strong>. This covers basic product design, documentation and FSSAI assistance, agreement signing, and 1–2 product samples. Total investment for a first batch typically ranges from ₹3–10 Lakhs depending on product type, MOQ, and packaging. Contact our sales team at sales@medralhealth.com for a detailed product-specific cost estimate before committing.</p></div>
